{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a lunar base. No memory. No explanation. No way to fight back.<br>Only the hum of failing machines... and something moving in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna: Obscura</strong> is a single-player psychological horror experience set in a remote moon base gone silent. With nothing but your wits and a flickering flashlight, you must uncover the truth behind the base\u2019s eerie emptiness\u2014and your own forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic, escape-room-style puzzles. Avoid unseen threats. And above all... stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Created by a small indie team of two\u2014a visual artist and a sound designer\u2014this is a handcrafted descent into isolation, fear, and forgotten memory.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3674110?t=1767654533","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674110/43b4af16f5148216a6e03a6f21651e958f2cd6cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767654533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674110/d75ba4d94b7a2416124cb8fa1dab6ae6a50491d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767654533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674110/d75ba4d94b7a2416124cb8fa1dab6ae6a50491d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767654533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements including themes of isolation, paranoia, and mental deterioration. Players may encounter disturbing imagery, intense atmosphere, and situations involving fear, helplessness, and emotional distress."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4026800,